{{Shortcut|Template:FA}}
{{Documentation/Header}}
This template provides a simple, customizable inline wrapper for inserting [https://fontawesome.com/ FontAwesome] icons into your wikitext. It supports FontAwesome 6's native utility classes, animations, and transformations using standard CSS variables.

== Syntax ==
{{T|FA|v1=type=icontype|v2=icon=icon_name|v3=class=utility_classes|v4=color=color|v5=size=custom_size|v6=animation-duration=time|v7=animation-iteration-count=number|v8=rotate-angle=angle|v9=style=extra_css|block=1}}

== Examples ==

=== Basic Sizing & Styling ===
Standard usage:
{{T|FA|p1=type=solid|p2=icon=music|p3=color=#68ecfa|_Y_=1}}

Using predefined FA sizing classes (<code>fa-2xs</code>, <code>fa-xs</code>, <code>fa-sm</code>, <code>fa-lg</code>, <code>fa-xl</code>, <code>fa-2xl</code>):
{{T|FA|p1=type=solid|p2=icon=people-group|p3=class=fa-xl|p4=color=rgb(177, 151, 252)|_Y_=1}}

Using a custom inline size (overrides FA classes):
{{T|FA|p1=icon=star|p2=size=3rem|p3=color=#ffcc00|_Y_=1}}

=== Animations ===
Standard fade:
{{T|FA|p1=type=solid|p2=icon=people-group|p3=class=fa-fade fa-xl|_Y_=1}}

A bounce effect with a custom speed and iteration count:
{{T|FA|p1=type=solid|p2=icon=people-group|p3=class=fa-bounce fa-xl|p4=animation-duration=3.5s|p5=animation-iteration-count=15|_Y_=1}}

=== Transformations ===
Flipping an icon vertically:
{{T|FA|p1=type=solid|p2=icon=people-group|p3=class=fa-flip-vertical fa-xl|p4=color=rgb(177, 151, 252)|_Y_=1}}

Using a static preset rotation:
{{T|FA|p1=type=solid|p2=icon=people-group|p3=class=fa-rotate-270|p4=color=rgb(255, 212, 59)|_Y_=1}}

Applying a precise, custom rotation (requires the `fa-rotate-by` class):
{{T|FA|p1=type=solid|p2=icon=people-group|p3=class=fa-rotate-by|p4=rotate-angle=11deg|p5=color=rgb(255, 212, 59)|_Y_=1}}

